    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Delgany Hills is a prestigious development built circa 2014 by Tower Homes in a highly desirable location close to all that Delgany and Greystones has to offer. This sought after development comprises of apartments, penthouses, and contemporary townhouses that enjoy large areas of open green spaces that are meticulously maintained. This large two-bedroom apartment, tastefully decorated boasts a modern design and high specification fixtures and fittings throughout. No. 1 is positioned on the Ground floor of Block 1, adjacent to a large green space that is the centre point of Delgany Hills. There is a security intercom system in place and there is a designated car parking space at surface level. The bright accommodation comprises briefly of an open plan livingroom / kitchen area, two double bedrooms, en-suite and main bathroom. Convenience is great here as Supermarkets, cafes, medical facilities, and fitness centres are all closeby. Greystones Dart station is only minutes drive away and the nearby motorways are easily accessed for Dublin commuting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:                          4.5m X 1.4m with Store Room. \r\n\r\nLivingroom cum Kitchen Area: 6m X 5.46m Large and bright room with high ceilings. Tiled kitchen floor. Contemporary fitted kitchen with built in oven, & dishwasher. \r\n\r\nBathroom:                                2.4m X 2.4m(max meas.) Tiled floor and part tiled walls. Bath with modern mixer tap and shower connection. Whb with mixer tap. Push flush wc. Heated towel rail & mirror. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:                     6.8m X 3m with wooden floors & fitted wardrobes. Ensuite: Tiled floor and part tiled walls. Step in shower unit. Whb with mixer tap. Push flush wc. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:                             3.6m X 2.9m with wooden floors & fitted wardrobes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas Fired Central Heating\r\n•\tComposite Aluclad double glazed windows\r\n•\t1 designated Car space plus the option to rent a second space from the mgt company subject to a nominal Annual charge\r\n•\tSecurity Intercom system.\r\n•\tLow density scheme with just 15 units per block.\r\n•\tVisitor Car parking"
